 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "tests whether ",
 StyleBox["fib", "TI"],
 " is a fiber bundle: isomorphic fibers, exactly one lift of each base edge \
at each vertex, trivial over every ball of radius 1.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"81ca3aa1-a52a-484d-8e68-38e13df0504e"],

Cell["\<\
With exactly one lift of every base edge, the horizontal edges over a ball \
form a covering of the ball. The bundle is trivial over the ball iff each \
component of this covering projects injectively.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3b9b0ee6-955e-4662-8ed5-91e0e764fe7b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ball is the closed ball of radius 1 of the reconstructed ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraBaseGraph"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraBaseGraph", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7673d2ed-c59a-430e-8bfb-0b74abdd3b76"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"24dad76d-8540-417f-9f56-3d441e99a745"]
}, Open  ]],

